From 4db1b342c986fa03dac41999021272acf5c02d3b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ivory <contact@ivory.cafe>
Date: Mon, 31 Aug 2026 12:27:02 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 3/9] Authenticate output preparation before granting target
 filesystem authority

Bind preparation requests to Binder identity, ProcessRecord state, PackageManager ownership, and one stable enabled generation, then transport the verified O_PATH capability through a one-shot socket envelope.

Constraint: Binder cannot directly serialize the required O_PATH directory descriptor
Rejected: Returning an ordinary external-storage directory FD | it would require system_server read access forbidden by platform storage neverallows
Confidence: high
Scope-risk: moderate
Directive: Preserve all four identity checks and fail closed before native configuration publication
Tested: framework-minus-apex and services production targets; device Binder/SCM_RIGHTS cold-start path
Not-tested: complete Framework test suite remains blocked by unrelated LockPattern test signature drift
Change-Id: I4b48d934e28bb8bc65deae8d9371e8dab0958e18
